{'symbol': 'RHI', 'date': '2022-03-15 10:04:00', 'title': 'NEARLY THREE-QUARTERS OF INTERNAL AUDIT LEADERS REPORT THEY ARE WORKING ON TRANSFORMATION INITIATIVES, ACCORDING TO NEW PROTIVITI SURVEY', 'text': "OVER HALF OF INTERNAL AUDIT LEADERS REPORT STRONG ROI FROM EFFORTS TO IMPLEMENT NEXT-GENERATION CONCEPTS IN TALENT, PROCESSES AND TECHNOLOGIES MENLO PARK, CALIF. , MARCH 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ACCORDING TO PROTIVITI'S 2022 NEXT-GENERATION INTERNAL AUDIT SURVEY, NEARLY THREE OUT OF FOUR (74%) CHIEF AUDIT EXECUTIVES (CAES) AND SENIOR INTERNAL AUDIT LEADERS REPORT THAT THEIR ORGANIZATIONS HAVE COMPLETED OR ARE CURRENTLY UNDERTAKING INITIATIVES TO TRANSFORM AND INNOVATE THEIR INTERNAL AUDIT FUNCTION."}